Z||000027||Oreif||12-15-2000||01:40 AM||||Just to put to bed the "who came first" issue,<BR>The Fiero was on paper in Oct 1979, The first mock up was July 1980, The first driveable Fiero was Aug 1981, and the Fiero was originally going to start being sold in 1982 but GM corporate wasn't sure they wanted to go ahead. In 1982 they started gearing up to sell for the 1984 model year. <BR>So let's hear the stat's on the MR2. (I don't know what they are)<P>* Source of above from HP Books "Fiero"||||reg||1
