Z||000048||Songman||12-18-2000||01:47 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Tone007:<BR><B>And I'm not sure, but I thought the MR2s were out in Japan before the Fieros came out.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Someone may have already pointed this out because I didn't read every response in this thread, but it doesn't really matter which came first between the MR2 and the Fiero. They are both copies of a Fiat X 1/9.<P>I have never owned an MR2, but I have owned X 1/9's and Fieros. I think they are all pretty nice cars. I don't have any idea which was fastest. When I wanted speed I either got in my 911 or my 69 Ram Air IV Judge...<P>There is more to life than speed...<P>||||reg||6
